        "collapsible_tab_LJjcwg": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Benefits",
            "icon": "heart",
            "content": "<p><strong>CLEAR - </strong>Supports your body's natural breakdown of acetaldehyde, the toxic alcohol byproduct that causes rough mornings.</p><p><strong>PROTECT - </strong>Promotes liver health and supports your natural detox pathways during alcohol metabolism.</p><p><strong>RESTORE - </strong>Replenishes the glutathione, B vitamins, and antioxidants that alcohol directly depletes overnight.</p><p><strong>SHOW UP - </strong>So you wake up feeling balanced, clear, and ready for whatever the day holds.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_VM3VmH": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it Works",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>When you drink, your liver converts alcohol into acetaldehyde - a highly toxic compound responsible for nausea, flushing, headaches, and hangovers.</p><p>ALDH2 enzymes further break down acetaldehyde into harmless acetate. But this process takes time - around one drink per hour - and is even slower for those with an ALDH2 deficiency (~50% of East Asians). This allows acetaldehyde to build up to dangerous levels.</p><p>Kanbae supercharges ALDH activity, boosts antioxidants, and replenishes nutrients to help clear acetaldehyde faster while protecting your liver.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_cq43dV": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When to Take",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p><strong>Before: </strong>Take 2 capsules (1 sachet) 15-30 minutes before drinking, as they take time to break down in your stomach.</p><p><strong>After: </strong>If you’ve had a heavy session, you can take up to 2 more capsules after your last drink.</p><p><strong>Reminder:</strong><br/>Drink responsibly.  Anti hangover pills are not designed to help you drink more than your personal limit, drive after drinking or ignore proper hydration and rest.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qDMLdF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Quality Standards",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Our products are formulated in-house by Singapore Health Sciences Authority (HSA) accredited experts.</p><p>KANBAE is the only anti-hangover brand to have been clinically tested for efficacy.</p><p>Our products are shipped from Singapore, third-party tested, and manufactured in a GMP-certified facility.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
